window.MLFF_MODEL = {"id":"cuequivariance","name":"cuEquivariance","fullName":"NVIDIA cuEquivariance: Segmented Polynomials and Optimized CUDA Kernels for Equivariant Neural Networks","year":2024,"authors":"NVIDIA（cuEquivariance 团队）","paper":{"title":"NVIDIA cuEquivariance Documentation","venue":"NVIDIA 官方文档 / GitHub（无配套论文）","url":"https://docs.nvidia.com/cuda/cuequivariance/"},"repos":["cuEquivariance"],"family":"infrastructure","tags":["基础设施 / 内核库","分段张量积 STP","融合 CUDA 内核","PyTorch + JAX","MACE / NequIP 加速后端","三角注意力"],"framework":"Python 前端（PyTorch / JAX / NumPy）+ 以二进制包 cuequivariance-ops-* 发布的 C++/CUDA 内核","license":"Apache-2.0（开源前端；CUDA 内核以二进制 wheel 单独分发）","oneLiner":"cuEquivariance 本身不是力场，而是 NVIDIA 的等变网络加速库：把球谐、CG 张量积、MACE 对称收缩等运算统一写成“分段张量积（SegmentedTensorProduct）/分段多项式”描述符，再交给融合 CUDA 内核执行；MACE、NequIP 只需替换算子、保留原权重即可提速。","analogy":"像把各家餐厅（MACE、NequIP……）的菜谱翻译成统一的“标准配方卡”：卡上只写“第 i 块食材 × 第 j 块食材 × 系数 → 放进第 k 个碗”。中央厨房（CUDA 内核）只要看懂这一种卡片，就能流水线批量烹饪，不必为每道菜单独打造厨具。","arch":{"geometry":"库本身不建图；提供 r̂ → 实球谐 Y_l^m（齐次多项式，默认先归一化）以及 O3/SO3/SU2 不可约表示与 CG 系数","equivariance":"由构造保证：路径系数全部来自 CG 系数或约化对称张量积基，任意 irreps 输入输出都严格等变","lmax":"不设上限，由调用方的 irreps / ls 决定","bodyOrder":"张量积为两输入双线性；symmetric_contraction 支持任意阶 degree（即 MACE 的 correlation ν）","layers":"n/a（算子库，层数由上层模型决定）","cutoff":"n/a（无邻居搜索；卷积层 tp_conv_fully_connected 只接收外部传入的 edge_envelope 衰减）","receptiveField":"n/a（由上层模型决定）","message":"通道级张量积 uv,iu,jv,kuv+ijk + input/output indices：gather(sender)→TP→scatter-add(receiver) 在一个内核内完成","readout":"n/a；提供等变 Linear（uv_iu_iv）、全连接张量积与按索引选权重的 indexed_linear","forces":"n/a","forcesDetail":"库不计算力；算子可微（PyTorch autograd、JAX JVP），上层模型对能量反传得到保守力","stress":"n/a（由上层模型通过应变求导实现）","longRange":"无","dispersion":"无","chargeSpin":"无","otherOutputs":"另提供 triangle_attention、triangle_multiplicative_update、attention_pair_bias（AlphaFold 类结构模型）","strictlyLocal":false,"complexity":"单次调用 ≈ batch × Σ_路径 einsum 代价（STP.flop 用 opt_einsum 估算）；卷积 ∝ E·C·P，对称收缩 ∝ N·C·P_ν","accel":"uniform_1d / fused_tp / indexed_linear CUDA 内核、naive 回退、FP32/FP64、JAX jit；MACE enable_cueq、NequIP enable_CuEquivariance"},"steps":[{"stage":"input","title":"核心抽象：分段张量积 SegmentedTensorProduct","plain":"cuEquivariance 把等变网络里的各种运算看成同一种东西：几个一维数组（operand），每个被切成若干“段”（segment，例如一个 l=2 的 irrep 块）；再列出一串“路径”（path），每条路径说明“输入 1 的第几段 × 输入 2 的第几段 × 系数 → 加到输出的第几段”。描述符与具体 irreps、与数据流都无关，只描述数学；参考实现就是逐路径做一个小 einsum 再累加。这样 CG 张量积、球谐、线性层都能交给同一套内核。","math":"\\mathrm{out}\\big[s_n^{(p)}\\big]\\mathrel{+}=\\sum_{p\\in\\text{paths}}\\operatorname{einsum}\\Big(C^{(p)},\\,x_1\\big[s_1^{(p)}\\big],\\dots,x_{n-1}\\big[s_{n-1}^{(p)}\\big]\\Big)","code":[{"repo":"cuEquivariance","file":"cuequivariance/cuequivariance/segmented_polynomials/segmented_tensor_product.py","start":47,"end":65,"lang":"python","excerpt":"class SegmentedTensorProduct:\n    \"\"\"\n    Irreps-agnostic and dataflow-agnostic descriptor of a segmented tensor product\n\n    Args:\n        operands (list of operands): The operands of the tensor product. To each operand corresponds subscripts and a list of segments.\n        paths (list of paths): Each path contains coefficients and a list of indices.\n            The indices are the indices of the segments of the operands.\n        coefficient_subscripts (str): The subscripts of the coefficients.\n\n\n    We typically use the :func:`from_subscripts <cuequivariance.SegmentedTensorProduct.from_subscripts>` method to create a descriptor and then add segments and paths one by one.\n\n    .. rubric:: Methods\n    \"\"\"\n\n    operands_and_subscripts: tuple[tuple[cue.SegmentedOperand, str], ...]\n    coefficient_subscripts: str\n    paths: tuple[Path, ...]","caption":"SegmentedTensorProduct：操作数（含下标与分段）+ 路径（段索引 + 系数）","url":"https://github.com/NVIDIA/cuEquivariance/blob/9ed8c7613a79861415071027249cc458e423be30/cuequivariance/cuequivariance/segmented_polynomials/segmented_tensor_product.py#L47-L65"},{"repo":"cuEquivariance","file":"cuequivariance/cuequivariance/segmented_polynomials/segmented_tensor_product.py","start":155,"end":178,"lang":"python","excerpt":"def from_subscripts(cls, subscripts: Subscripts) -> SegmentedTensorProduct:\n    r\"\"\"\n    Create a descriptor from a subscripts string.\n\n    Examples:\n        >>> d = cue.SegmentedTensorProduct.from_subscripts(\"uv,ui,vj+ij\")\n        >>> i0 = d.add_segment(0, (2, 3))\n        >>> i1 = d.add_segment(1, (2, 5))\n        >>> i2 = d.add_segment(2, (3, 4))\n        >>> d.add_path(i0, i1, i2, c=np.ones((5, 4)))\n        0\n        >>> print(d)\n        uv,ui,vj+ij operands=[(2, 3)],[(2, 5)],[(3, 4)] paths=[op0[0]*op1[0]*op2[0]*c c.shape=(5, 4) c.nnz=20]\n    \"\"\"\n    subscripts = Subscripts(subscripts)\n    operands = [\n        cue.SegmentedOperand(ndim=len(operand)) for operand in subscripts.operands\n    ]\n\n    return cls(\n        operands_and_subscripts=list(zip(operands, subscripts.operands)),\n        paths=[],\n        coefficient_subscripts=subscripts.coefficients,\n    )","caption":"from_subscripts：用 einsum 式下标字符串创建描述符，再 add_segment / add_path","url":"https://github.com/NVIDIA/cuEquivariance/blob/9ed8c7613a79861415071027249cc458e423be30/cuequivariance/cuequivariance/segmented_polynomials/segmented_tensor_product.py#L155-L178"},{"repo":"cuEquivariance","file":"cuequivariance/cuequivariance/segmented_polynomials/evaluate.py","start":100,"end":137,"lang":"python","excerpt":"num_operands = len(operand_subscripts)\ninputs_subscripts = \",\".join(\"...\" + s for s in operand_subscripts[:-1])\nif inputs_subscripts:\n    formula = (\n        f\"{coefficient_subscripts},{inputs_subscripts}->...{operand_subscripts[-1]}\"\n    )\nelse:\n    formula = f\"{coefficient_subscripts}->{operand_subscripts[-1]}\"\n\noutput = np.zeros(\n    output_batch_shape + (sum(segment_sizes[-1]),),\n    dtype=dtype,\n)\n\ninputs = [np.moveaxis(input, k, -1) for input, k in zip(inputs, segment_axes)]\n\nfor idxx, coeff in zip(indices, coefficients):\n    slices = [\n        slice(\n            segment_offsets[oid][idxx[oid]],\n            segment_offsets[oid][idxx[oid]] + segment_sizes[oid][idxx[oid]],\n        )\n        for oid in range(num_operands)\n    ]\n    output[..., slices[-1]] += np.reshape(\n        np.einsum(\n            formula,\n            coeff,\n            *[\n                np.reshape(\n                    inputs[oid][..., slices[oid]],\n                    inputs[oid].shape[:-1] + segment_shapes[oid][idxx[oid]],\n                )\n                for oid in range(num_operands - 1)\n            ],\n        ),\n        output_batch_shape + (math.prod(segment_shapes[-1][idxx[-1]]),),\n    )","caption":"NumPy 参考语义：对每条路径切出各操作数的段、做 einsum、累加到输出段","url":"https://github.com/NVIDIA/cuEquivariance/blob/9ed8c7613a79861415071027249cc458e423be30/cuequivariance/cuequivariance/segmented_polynomials/evaluate.py#L100-L137"}]},{"stage":"input","title":"内存布局：mul_ir（e3nn）与 ir_mul","plain":"同一组 irreps 在内存里可以“通道在外、m 在内”（mul_ir，e3nn 的习惯，每块形状 (mul, 2l+1)），也可以“m 在外、通道在内”（ir_mul，形状 (2l+1, mul)）。cuEquivariance 的描述符内部统一用 ir_mul：把 m 拆进路径之后只剩通道维 u 这一个“均匀模式”，正好适合 uniform_1d 内核。对外则用 TransposeIrrepsLayout 在两种布局间转置，保证能直接接到 e3nn 风格的模型上；布局相同时转置退化为恒等映射。","math":"\\texttt{mul\\_ir}:\\ x_{u,m}\\in\\mathbb R^{\\mathrm{mul}\\times(2l+1)}\\qquad\\texttt{ir\\_mul}:\\ x_{m,u}\\in\\mathbb R^{(2l+1)\\times\\mathrm{mul}}","code":[{"repo":"cuEquivariance","file":"cuequivariance/cuequivariance/group_theory/irreps_array/irreps_layout.py","start":23,"end":65,"lang":"python","excerpt":"class IrrepsLayout(Enum):\n    \"\"\"\n    Enum for the possible data layouts.\n\n    Attributes:\n        mul_ir: Multiplicity first, then irreducible representation.\n            This layout corresponds to the layout used in the library `e3nn`.\n        ir_mul: Irreducible representation first, then multiplicity.\n            This layout differs from the one used in `e3nn` but can be more convenient in some cases.\n\n    Examples:\n        >>> cue.mul_ir\n        (mul,irrep)\n\n        >>> cue.ir_mul\n        (irrep,mul)\n\n    .. rubric:: Methods\n    \"\"\"\n\n    mul_ir = auto()\n    ir_mul = auto()\n\n    def shape(\n        self, mulir: Union[cue.MulIrrep, tuple[int, cue.Irrep]]\n    ) -> tuple[int, int]:\n        \"\"\"The shape of the tensor for the given layout.\n\n        Examples:\n            >>> mulir = cue.MulIrrep(32, cue.O3(2, -1))\n            >>> mulir\n            32x2o\n\n            >>> cue.mul_ir.shape(mulir)\n            (32, 5)\n\n            >>> cue.ir_mul.shape(mulir)\n            (5, 32)\n        \"\"\"\n        mul, ir = mulir\n        if self == IrrepsLayout.mul_ir:\n            return (mul, ir.dim)\n        return (ir.dim, mul)","caption":"IrrepsLayout：mul_ir 对应 e3nn，ir_mul 为 irrep 维在前","url":"https://github.com/NVIDIA/cuEquivariance/blob/9ed8c7613a79861415071027249cc458e423be30/cuequivariance/cuequivariance/group_theory/irreps_array/irreps_layout.py#L23-L65"},{"repo":"cuEquivariance","file":"cuequivariance_torch/cuequivariance_torch/primitives/transpose.py","start":43,"end":56,"lang":"python","excerpt":"if (source, target) == (cue.mul_ir, cue.ir_mul):\n    self.f = TransposeSegments(\n        [(mul, ir.dim) for mul, ir in irreps],\n        device=device,\n        use_fallback=use_fallback,\n    )\nelif (source, target) == (cue.ir_mul, cue.mul_ir):\n    self.f = TransposeSegments(\n        [(ir.dim, mul) for mul, ir in irreps],\n        device=device,\n        use_fallback=use_fallback,\n    )\nelse:\n    self.f = torch.nn.Identity()","caption":"TransposeIrrepsLayout：两种布局间逐段转置，相同布局则为 Identity","url":"https://github.com/NVIDIA/cuEquivariance/blob/9ed8c7613a79861415071027249cc458e423be30/cuequivariance_torch/cuequivariance_torch/primitives/transpose.py#L43-L56"}]},{"stage":"geometry","title":"球谐函数：也是一个分段多项式","plain":"边方向 r̂ 的实球谐 Y_l^m 是 x、y、z 的 l 次齐次多项式。cuEquivariance 用 sympy 生成每个 Y_l^m 的系数，把“同一个向量输入重复 l 次”写成 STP 的 l 个操作数，每个单项式 x^a y^b z^c 就是一条路径；多个 l 再堆叠（stack）成一个多项式。PyTorch 模块 SphericalHarmonics 默认先把向量归一化，再交给 uniform_1d 内核计算。","math":"\\hat{\\mathbf r}=\\frac{\\mathbf r}{\\lVert\\mathbf r\\rVert},\\qquad Y_l^m(\\hat{\\mathbf r})=\\sum_{a+b+c=l}c^{lm}_{abc}\\,\\hat x^{a}\\hat y^{b}\\hat z^{c}","code":[{"repo":"cuEquivariance","file":"cuequivariance/cuequivariance/group_theory/descriptors/spherical_harmonics_.py","start":23,"end":52,"lang":"python","excerpt":"def _spherical_harmonics_core(\n    ir_vec: cue.Irrep, ls: list[int]\n) -> tuple[cue.SegmentedPolynomial, cue.Irreps]:\n    if len(ls) != 1:\n        results = [_spherical_harmonics_core(ir_vec, [ell]) for ell in ls]\n        poly = cue.SegmentedPolynomial.stack([r[0] for r in results], [False, True])\n        irreps_out = cue.Irreps(type(ir_vec), sum([list(r[1]) for r in results], []))\n        return poly, irreps_out\n\n    [ell] = ls\n    ir, formula = sympy_spherical_harmonics(ir_vec, ell)\n\n    assert ir_vec.dim == 3\n    d = cue.SegmentedTensorProduct.empty_segments([3] * ell + [ir.dim])\n    for i in range(ir.dim):\n        for degrees, coeff in (\n            sympy.Poly(formula[i], sympy.symbols(\"x:3\")).as_dict().items()\n        ):\n            indices = poly_degrees_to_path_indices(degrees)\n            d.add_path(*indices, i, c=coeff)\n\n    d = d.symmetrize_operands(range(ell), force=True)\n\n    poly = cue.SegmentedPolynomial(\n        [cue.SegmentedOperand([()] * 3)],\n        [cue.SegmentedOperand([()] * ir.dim)],\n        [(cue.Operation([0] * ell + [1]), d)],\n    )\n    irreps_out = cue.Irreps(type(ir_vec), [(1, ir)])\n    return poly, irreps_out","caption":"_spherical_harmonics_core：多项式系数 → 路径；对重复操作数对称化","url":"https://github.com/NVIDIA/cuEquivariance/blob/9ed8c7613a79861415071027249cc458e423be30/cuequivariance/cuequivariance/group_theory/descriptors/spherical_harmonics_.py#L23-L52"},{"repo":"cuEquivariance","file":"cuequivariance_torch/cuequivariance_torch/operations/spherical_harmonics.py","start":55,"end":93,"lang":"python","excerpt":"    e = descriptors.spherical_harmonics(cue.SO3(1), self.ls)\n\n    if method is None:\n        if use_fallback is None:\n            # No warning here as it's the default behavior\n            self.method = \"uniform_1d\"\n        else:\n            warnings.warn(\n                \"`use_fallback` is deprecated, please use `method` instead\",\n                DeprecationWarning,\n            )\n            self.method = \"naive\" if use_fallback else \"uniform_1d\"\n    else:\n        self.method = method\n\n    self.f = cuet.SegmentedPolynomial(\n        e.polynomial,\n        method=self.method,\n        math_dtype=math_dtype,\n    ).to(device)\n\ndef forward(self, vectors: torch.Tensor) -> torch.Tensor:\n    \"\"\"\n    Args:\n        vectors (torch.Tensor): Input vectors of shape (batch, 3).\n\n    Returns:\n        torch.Tensor: The spherical harmonics of the input vectors of shape (batch, dim),\n        where dim is the sum of 2*l+1 for l in ls.\n    \"\"\"\n    torch._assert(\n        vectors.ndim == 2, f\"Input must have shape (batch, 3) - got {vectors.shape}\"\n    )\n\n    if self.normalize:\n        vectors = torch.nn.functional.normalize(vectors, dim=1)\n\n    [output] = self.f([vectors])\n    return output","caption":"cuet.SphericalHarmonics：默认归一化 + uniform_1d 方法","url":"https://github.com/NVIDIA/cuEquivariance/blob/9ed8c7613a79861415071027249cc458e423be30/cuequivariance_torch/cuequivariance_torch/operations/spherical_harmonics.py#L55-L93"}]},{"stage":"interaction","title":"通道级张量积：NequIP / MACE 卷积的核心","plain":"消息传递里最贵的一步是“邻居特征 h_j ⊗ 球谐 Y(r̂_ij)”的 CG 张量积，每个通道各算各的（channelwise），权重来自径向 MLP。描述符 channelwise_tensor_product 对每一对输入 irreps (l1, l2)、每个允许的输出 l3 和每组 CG 系数添加一条路径；下标 uv,iu,jv,kuv+ijk 表示“权重[uv]·输入1[iu]·输入2[jv] → 输出[kuv]，系数 C_ijk”，最后按输出对路径归一化。PyTorch 层 ChannelWiseTensorProduct 前后做布局转置、中间调用一次 SegmentedPolynomial；MACE 的 TensorProduct 包装器在 cueq_config 打开时直接换成它（或换成融合版本）。","math":"z^{(l_1l_2\\to l_3)}_{k,uv}=\\sum_{i,j}C^{l_3}_{ijk}\\;w_{uv}\\;x_{i,u}\\;Y_{j,v}\\qquad(\\texttt{uv,iu,jv,kuv+ijk})","code":[{"repo":"cuEquivariance","file":"cuequivariance/cuequivariance/group_theory/descriptors/irreps_tp.py","start":232,"end":270,"lang":"python","excerpt":"def _channelwise_tensor_product_core(\n    irreps1: cue.Irreps,\n    irreps2: cue.Irreps,\n    irreps3_filter,\n    simplify_irreps3: bool,\n) -> tuple[cue.SegmentedPolynomial, cue.Irreps]:\n    G = irreps1.irrep_class\n\n    if irreps3_filter is not None:\n        irreps3_filter = into_list_of_irrep(G, irreps3_filter)\n\n    d = cue.SegmentedTensorProduct.from_subscripts(\"uv,iu,jv,kuv+ijk\")\n\n    for mul, ir in irreps1:\n        d.add_segment(1, (ir.dim, mul))\n    for mul, ir in irreps2:\n        d.add_segment(2, (ir.dim, mul))\n\n    irreps3 = []\n\n    for (i1, (mul1, ir1)), (i2, (mul2, ir2)) in itertools.product(\n        enumerate(irreps1), enumerate(irreps2)\n    ):\n        for ir3 in ir1 * ir2:\n            if irreps3_filter is not None and ir3 not in irreps3_filter:\n                continue\n\n            # for loop over the different solutions of the Clebsch-Gordan decomposition\n            for cg in cue.clebsch_gordan(ir1, ir2, ir3):\n                d.add_path(None, i1, i2, None, c=cg, dims={\"u\": mul1, \"v\": mul2})\n\n                irreps3.append((mul1 * mul2, ir3))\n\n    irreps3 = cue.Irreps(G, irreps3)\n    irreps3, perm, inv = irreps3.sort()\n    d = d.permute_segments(0, inv)\n    d = d.permute_segments(3, inv)\n\n    d = d.normalize_paths_for_operand(-1)","caption":"_channelwise_tensor_product_core：遍历 (l1,l2→l3) 与 CG 解，逐条 add_path","url":"https://github.com/NVIDIA/cuEquivariance/blob/9ed8c7613a79861415071027249cc458e423be30/cuequivariance/cuequivariance/group_theory/descriptors/irreps_tp.py#L232-L270"},{"repo":"cuEquivariance","file":"cuequivariance_torch/cuequivariance_torch/operations/tp_channel_wise.py","start":221,"end":258,"lang":"python","excerpt":"x1 = self.transpose_in1(x1)\nx2 = self.transpose_in2(x2)\n\nindices_in: Dict[int, torch.Tensor] = {}\nif indices_1 is not None:\n    indices_in[1] = indices_1\nif indices_2 is not None:\n    indices_in[2] = indices_2\ndict_indices_out: Dict[int, torch.Tensor] = {}\nif indices_out is not None:\n    dict_indices_out = {0: indices_out}\n    if size_out is None:\n        raise ValueError(\n            \"size_out should be provided if indices_out is provided\"\n        )\n    else:\n        sizes_out = {0: torch.empty(size_out, 1).to(x1.device)}\nelse:\n    sizes_out: Dict[int, torch.Tensor] = {}\n\nif self.weight is not None:\n    if weight is not None:\n        raise ValueError(\"Internal weights are used, weight should be None\")\n    else:\n        weight = self.weight\nelse:\n    if weight is None:\n        raise ValueError(\n            \"Internal weights are not used, weight should not be None\"\n        )\n\noutput = self.f(\n    [weight, x1, x2],\n    input_indices=indices_in,\n    output_shapes=sizes_out,\n    output_indices=dict_indices_out,\n)\nreturn self.transpose_out(output[0])","caption":"ChannelWiseTensorProduct.forward：转置 → SegmentedPolynomial([weight, x1, x2]) → 转置","url":"https://github.com/NVIDIA/cuEquivariance/blob/9ed8c7613a79861415071027249cc458e423be30/cuequivariance_torch/cuequivariance_torch/operations/tp_channel_wise.py#L221-L258"},{"repo":"mace","file":"mace/modules/wrapper_ops.py","start":285,"end":319,"lang":"python","excerpt":"if (\n    CUET_AVAILABLE\n    and cueq_config is not None\n    and cueq_config.enabled\n    and (cueq_config.optimize_all or cueq_config.optimize_channelwise)\n):\n    if cueq_config.conv_fusion and use_conv_fusion:\n        polynomial = (\n            cue.descriptors.channelwise_tensor_product(\n                cue.Irreps(cueq_config.group, irreps_in1),\n                cue.Irreps(cueq_config.group, irreps_in2),\n                cue.Irreps(cueq_config.group, irreps_out),\n            )\n            .flatten_coefficient_modes()\n            .squeeze_modes()\n            .polynomial\n        )\n        return with_cueq_conv_fusion(\n            cuet.SegmentedPolynomial(\n                polynomial,\n                math_dtype=torch.get_default_dtype(),\n                method=\"uniform_1d\",\n            ),\n            polynomial,\n        )\n    return cuet.ChannelWiseTensorProduct(\n        cue.Irreps(cueq_config.group, irreps_in1),\n        cue.Irreps(cueq_config.group, irreps_in2),\n        cue.Irreps(cueq_config.group, irreps_out),\n        layout=cueq_config.layout,\n        shared_weights=shared_weights,\n        internal_weights=internal_weights,\n        dtype=torch.get_default_dtype(),\n        math_dtype=torch.get_default_dtype(),\n    )","caption":"MACE TensorProduct 包装器：cueq 打开时用通道级描述符（可选卷积融合）","url":"https://github.com/ACEsuit/mace/blob/7215fadd3b591444ab2c07634e84419685a48e87/mace/modules/wrapper_ops.py#L285-L319"}]},{"stage":"interaction","title":"融合 gather–张量积–scatter：一次内核完成消息传递","plain":"朴素实现要先把 node_feats[sender] 复制成“每条边一份”的大张量，做完张量积再 scatter_sum 回接收原子，显存和带宽都耗在中间张量上。cuEquivariance 的 SegmentedPolynomial 支持 input_indices / output_indices：MACE 的 conv_fusion 把 {1: sender} 作为输入索引、{0: receiver} 作为输出索引；NequIP 则用 method=fused_tp 做同样的事。于是“取邻居特征—张量积—累加到中心原子”在内核里一次完成。","math":"\\mathbf m_i=\\sum_{e:\\,\\mathrm{dst}(e)=i}\\mathrm{TP}\\Big(w_e,\\ \\mathbf h_{\\mathrm{src}(e)},\\ Y(\\hat{\\mathbf r}_e)\\Big)","code":[{"repo":"mace","file":"mace/modules/wrapper_ops.py","start":177,"end":192,"lang":"python","excerpt":"def forward(\n    self,\n    node_feats: torch.Tensor,\n    edge_attrs: torch.Tensor,\n    tp_weights: torch.Tensor,\n    edge_index: torch.Tensor,\n) -> torch.Tensor:\n    sender = edge_index[0]\n    receiver = edge_index[1]\n\n    return self.conv_tp(\n        [tp_weights, node_feats, edge_attrs],\n        {1: sender},\n        {0: node_feats},\n        {0: receiver},\n    )[0]","caption":"CueqConvFusionWrapper.forward：sender 作输入索引、receiver 作输出索引","url":"https://github.com/ACEsuit/mace/blob/7215fadd3b591444ab2c07634e84419685a48e87/mace/modules/wrapper_ops.py#L177-L192"},{"repo":"mace","file":"mace/modules/blocks.py","start":1017,"end":1029,"lang":"python","excerpt":"tp_weights = self.conv_tp_weights(edge_feats)\nif cutoff is not None:\n    tp_weights = tp_weights * cutoff\nmessage = None\nif hasattr(self, \"conv_fusion\"):\n    message = self.conv_tp(node_feats, edge_attrs, tp_weights, edge_index)\nelse:\n    mji = self.conv_tp(\n        node_feats[edge_index[0]], edge_attrs, tp_weights\n    )  # [n_nodes, irreps]\n    message = scatter_sum(\n        src=mji, index=edge_index[1], dim=0, dim_size=node_feats.shape[0]\n    )","caption":"MACE 交互块：有 conv_fusion 时直接得到 message，否则 gather + scatter_sum","url":"https://github.com/ACEsuit/mace/blob/7215fadd3b591444ab2c07634e84419685a48e87/mace/modules/blocks.py#L1017-L1029"},{"repo":"nequip","file":"nequip/nn/_tp_scatter_cueq.py","start":94,"end":122,"lang":"python","excerpt":"    self.tp_conv = cuet.SegmentedPolynomial(\n        nequip_tp_desc(\n            cue.Irreps(O3_e3nn, feature_irreps_in),\n            cue.Irreps(O3_e3nn, irreps_edge_attr),\n            cue.Irreps(O3_e3nn, irreps_mid),\n        )\n        .flatten_coefficient_modes()\n        .squeeze_modes()\n        .polynomial,\n        method=\"fused_tp\",\n        math_dtype=self.model_dtype,\n    )\n\n    self.transpose_feat = cuet.TransposeIrrepsLayout(\n        feature_irreps_in, source=cue.mul_ir, target=cue.ir_mul\n    )\n    self.transpose_out = cuet.TransposeIrrepsLayout(\n        irreps_mid, source=cue.ir_mul, target=cue.mul_ir\n    )\n\ndef forward(self, x, edge_attr, edge_weight, edge_dst, edge_src):\n    return self.transpose_out(\n        self.tp_conv(\n            [edge_weight, self.transpose_feat(x), edge_attr],\n            {1: edge_src},\n            {0: x},\n            {0: edge_dst},\n        )[0]\n    )","caption":"NequIP：CuEquivarianceTensorProductScatter 用 fused_tp 完成 TP + scatter","url":"https://github.com/mir-group/nequip/blob/27d9d2182da918ab7be0017d8300e53278f5e00e/nequip/nn/_tp_scatter_cueq.py#L94-L122"}]},{"stage":"interaction","title":"对称收缩：MACE 高体序 B 基的专用描述符","plain":"MACE 每层把原子基 A 与自身相乘 ν 次，再投影回各 L 通道。symmetric_contraction 为每个阶数 degree 构造一个 STP：同一个输入重复 degree 次，系数是约化对称张量积基 U（同时保证置换对称与旋转等变），所有通道 u 并行；多个阶数再堆叠成一个多项式。权重按中心原子元素 z 选取——PyTorch 层把元素编号作为 input_indices 交给内核，不必先复制一份逐原子的权重。MACE 的 SymmetricContractionWrapper 在 optimize_symmetric 打开时换成 cuet.SymmetricContraction。","math":"B_{i,u}=\\sum_{\\nu=1}^{\\nu_{\\max}}\\sum_{w}W^{(\\nu)}_{z,\\,wu}\\sum_{a_1\\cdots a_\\nu}U^{(\\nu)}_{a_1\\cdots a_\\nu\\,i\\,w}\\prod_{\\xi=1}^{\\nu}A_{a_\\xi,u}","code":[{"repo":"cuEquivariance","file":"cuequivariance/cuequivariance/group_theory/descriptors/symmetric_contractions.py","start":57,"end":88,"lang":"python","excerpt":"else:\n    abc = \"abcdefgh\"[:degree]\n    d = cue.SegmentedTensorProduct.from_subscripts(\n        f\"w_{'_'.join(f'{a}' for a in abc)}_i+{abc}iw\"\n    )\n\n    for i in input_operands:\n        d.add_segment(i, (irreps_in.dim,))\n\n    U = cue.reduced_symmetric_tensor_product_basis(\n        irreps_in, degree, keep_ir=irreps_out, layout=cue.ir_mul\n    )\n    for _, ir in irreps_out:\n        u = U.filter(keep=ir)\n        if len(u.segments) == 0:\n            d.add_segment(output_operand, {\"i\": ir.dim})\n        else:\n            [u] = u.segments  # (a, b, c, ..., i, w)\n            d.add_path(None, *(0,) * degree, None, c=u)\n\n    d = d.normalize_paths_for_operand(output_operand)\n    d = d.flatten_coefficient_modes()\n\nd = d.append_modes_to_all_operands(\"u\", {\"u\": mul})\nfor i in input_operands:\n    assert d.operands[i] == input_operand\n\nreturn cue.SegmentedPolynomial(\n    [d.operands[0], input_operand],\n    [d.operands[-1]],\n    [(cue.Operation([0] + [1] * degree + [2]), d)],\n)","caption":"_symmetric_contraction_core：下标 w_a_b_c_i+abciw，系数为约化对称基，再附加通道模式 u","url":"https://github.com/NVIDIA/cuEquivariance/blob/9ed8c7613a79861415071027249cc458e423be30/cuequivariance/cuequivariance/group_theory/descriptors/symmetric_contractions.py#L57-L88"},{"repo":"cuEquivariance","file":"cuequivariance_torch/cuequivariance_torch/operations/symmetric_contraction.py","start":235,"end":242,"lang":"python","excerpt":"if self.projection is not None:\n    weight = torch.einsum(\"zau,ab->zbu\", self.weight, self.projection)\nelse:\n    weight = self.weight\nweight = weight.flatten(1)\n\noutput = self.f([weight, self.transpose_in(x)], input_indices={0: indices})\nreturn self.transpose_out(output[0])","caption":"SymmetricContraction.forward：按元素索引选择权重","url":"https://github.com/NVIDIA/cuEquivariance/blob/9ed8c7613a79861415071027249cc458e423be30/cuequivariance_torch/cuequivariance_torch/operations/symmetric_contraction.py#L235-L242"},{"repo":"mace","file":"mace/modules/wrapper_ops.py","start":428,"end":445,"lang":"python","excerpt":"use_reduced_cg = use_reduced_cg and CUET_AVAILABLE\nif (\n    CUET_AVAILABLE\n    and cueq_config is not None\n    and cueq_config.enabled\n    and (cueq_config.optimize_all or cueq_config.optimize_symmetric)\n):\n    return cuet.SymmetricContraction(\n        cue.Irreps(cueq_config.group, irreps_in),\n        cue.Irreps(cueq_config.group, irreps_out),\n        layout_in=cue.ir_mul,\n        layout_out=cueq_config.layout,\n        contraction_degree=correlation,\n        num_elements=num_elements,\n        original_mace=(not use_reduced_cg),\n        dtype=torch.get_default_dtype(),\n        math_dtype=torch.get_default_dtype(),\n    )","caption":"MACE SymmetricContractionWrapper：contraction_degree = correlation","url":"https://github.com/ACEsuit/mace/blob/7215fadd3b591444ab2c07634e84419685a48e87/mace/modules/wrapper_ops.py#L428-L445"}]},{"stage":"readout","title":"全连接张量积与等变线性层","plain":"除卷积外，等变网络还需要“混合通道”的运算：全连接张量积（uvw,iu,jv,kw+ijk，每对输入通道 u、v 到每个输出通道 w 都有独立权重）和等变线性层（uv_iu_iv：只在同一种 irrep 内做通道混合，系数恒为 1，因此天然等变）。它们同样只是路径不同的 STP。MACE 的 Linear / FullyConnectedTensorProduct 包装器在 cueq 模式下分别换成 cuet.Linear、cuet.FullyConnectedTensorProduct。","math":"z_{k,w}=\\sum_{u,v}\\sum_{i,j}C_{ijk}\\,W_{uvw}\\,x_{i,u}\\,y_{j,v}\\qquad\\text{Linear: }z_{i,v}=\\sum_{u}W_{uv}\\,x_{i,u}","code":[{"repo":"cuEquivariance","file":"cuequivariance/cuequivariance/group_theory/descriptors/irreps_tp.py","start":22,"end":47,"lang":"python","excerpt":"def _fully_connected_tensor_product_core(\n    irreps1: cue.Irreps, irreps2: cue.Irreps, irreps3: cue.Irreps\n) -> cue.SegmentedPolynomial:\n    G = irreps1.irrep_class\n\n    d = cue.SegmentedTensorProduct.from_subscripts(\"uvw,iu,jv,kw+ijk\")\n\n    for mul, ir in irreps1:\n        d.add_segment(1, (ir.dim, mul))\n    for mul, ir in irreps2:\n        d.add_segment(2, (ir.dim, mul))\n    for mul, ir in irreps3:\n        d.add_segment(3, (ir.dim, mul))\n\n    for (i1, (mul1, ir1)), (i2, (mul2, ir2)), (i3, (mul3, ir3)) in itertools.product(\n        enumerate(irreps1), enumerate(irreps2), enumerate(irreps3)\n    ):\n        if ir3 not in ir1 * ir2:\n            continue\n\n        # for loop over the different solutions of the Clebsch-Gordan decomposition\n        for cg in G.clebsch_gordan(ir1, ir2, ir3):\n            d.add_path((mul1, mul2, mul3), i1, i2, i3, c=cg)\n\n    d = d.normalize_paths_for_operand(-1)\n    return cue.SegmentedPolynomial.eval_last_operand(d)","caption":"_fully_connected_tensor_product_core：每个 (l1,l2,l3) 组合一条带 CG 系数的路径","url":"https://github.com/NVIDIA/cuEquivariance/blob/9ed8c7613a79861415071027249cc458e423be30/cuequivariance/cuequivariance/group_theory/descriptors/irreps_tp.py#L22-L47"},{"repo":"cuEquivariance","file":"cuequivariance/cuequivariance/group_theory/descriptors/irreps_tp.py","start":505,"end":518,"lang":"python","excerpt":"def _linear_core(\n    irreps_in: cue.Irreps, irreps_out: cue.Irreps\n) -> cue.SegmentedPolynomial:\n    d = cue.SegmentedTensorProduct.from_subscripts(\"uv_iu_iv\")\n    for mul, ir in irreps_in:\n        d.add_segment(1, (ir.dim, mul))\n    for mul, ir in irreps_out:\n        d.add_segment(2, (ir.dim, mul))\n\n    for (i1, (mul1, ir1)), (i2, (mul2, ir2)) in itertools.product(\n        enumerate(irreps_in), enumerate(irreps_out)\n    ):\n        if ir1 == ir2:\n            d.add_path((mul1, mul2), i1, i2, c=1.0)","caption":"_linear_core：同 irrep 之间的通道混合","url":"https://github.com/NVIDIA/cuEquivariance/blob/9ed8c7613a79861415071027249cc458e423be30/cuequivariance/cuequivariance/group_theory/descriptors/irreps_tp.py#L505-L518"},{"repo":"mace","file":"mace/modules/wrapper_ops.py","start":90,"end":102,"lang":"python","excerpt":"if (\n    CUET_AVAILABLE\n    and cueq_config is not None\n    and cueq_config.enabled\n    and (cueq_config.optimize_all or cueq_config.optimize_linear)\n):\n    return cuet.Linear(\n        cue.Irreps(cueq_config.group, irreps_in),\n        cue.Irreps(cueq_config.group, irreps_out),\n        layout=cueq_config.layout,\n        shared_weights=shared_weights,\n        method=\"naive\",\n    )","caption":"MACE Linear 包装器：cueq 模式用 cuet.Linear","url":"https://github.com/ACEsuit/mace/blob/7215fadd3b591444ab2c07634e84419685a48e87/mace/modules/wrapper_ops.py#L90-L102"}]},{"stage":"output","title":"后端分派：naive / uniform_1d / fused_tp / indexed_linear","plain":"同一个描述符可以有多种执行方式：naive 是纯 PyTorch 实现（处处可用但慢）；uniform_1d 是要求所有段等长的 CUDA 内核，经 torch.ops.cuequivariance.uniform_1d 调用；fused_tp 支持更一般的 3/4 操作数收缩；indexed_linear 面向按索引选权重的线性层。真正的 CUDA 代码在二进制包 cuequivariance_ops_torch / cuequivariance-ops-jax 里，开源仓库只包含分派与参数打包的 Python 前端；若内核包未安装，则自动退回 naive 并给出警告。","math":"\\texttt{method}\\in\\{\\texttt{naive},\\ \\texttt{uniform\\_1d},\\ \\texttt{fused\\_tp},\\ \\texttt{indexed\\_linear}\\}","code":[{"repo":"cuEquivariance","file":"cuequivariance_torch/cuequivariance_torch/primitives/segmented_polynomial.py","start":181,"end":220,"lang":"python","excerpt":"if method != \"naive\" and not HAS_CUE_OPS:\n    method = \"naive\"\n    warnings.warn(\n        \"cuequivariance_ops_torch is not available. Falling back to naive implementation.\"\n    )\n\nif method == \"uniform_1d\":\n    try:\n        self.m = SegmentedPolynomialFromUniform1dJit(\n            polynomial, math_dtype, output_dtype_map, name, self.options\n        )\n    except ImportError:\n        method = \"naive\"\n        warnings.warn(\n            \"uniform_1d backend is not available. \"\n            \"Falling back to naive implementation.\"\n        )\n        self.m = SegmentedPolynomialNaive(\n            polynomial, math_dtype, output_dtype_map, name\n        )\nelif method == \"naive\":\n    self.m = SegmentedPolynomialNaive(\n        polynomial, math_dtype, output_dtype_map, name\n    )\nelif method == \"fused_tp\":\n    try:\n        self.m = SegmentedPolynomialFusedTP(\n            polynomial, math_dtype, output_dtype_map, name\n        )\n    except ImportError:\n        method = \"naive\"\n        warnings.warn(\n            \"fused_tp backend is not available. \"\n            \"Falling back to naive implementation.\"\n        )\n        self.m = SegmentedPolynomialNaive(\n            polynomial, math_dtype, output_dtype_map, name\n        )\nelif method == \"indexed_linear\":\n    try:","caption":"cuet.SegmentedPolynomial：按 method 选择实现，缺少内核包时回退 naive","url":"https://github.com/NVIDIA/cuEquivariance/blob/9ed8c7613a79861415071027249cc458e423be30/cuequivariance_torch/cuequivariance_torch/primitives/segmented_polynomial.py#L181-L220"},{"repo":"cuEquivariance","file":"cuequivariance_torch/cuequivariance_torch/primitives/segmented_polynomial_uniform_1d.py","start":24,"end":56,"lang":"python","excerpt":"try:\n    from cuequivariance_ops_torch.uniform_1d import (\n        BATCH_DIM_AUTO,\n        BATCH_DIM_BATCHED,\n        BATCH_DIM_INDEXED,\n        BATCH_DIM_SHARED,\n    )\n\n    def uniform_1d(\n        name: str,\n        math_dtype: torch.dtype,\n        operand_extent: int,\n        num_inputs: int,\n        num_outputs: int,\n        num_index: int,\n        buffer_dim: List[int],\n        buffer_num_segments: List[int],\n        batch_dim: List[int],\n        index_buffer: List[int],\n        dtypes: List[int],\n        num_operations: int,\n        num_operands: List[int],\n        operations: List[int],\n        num_paths: List[int],\n        path_indices_start: List[int],\n        path_coefficients_start: List[int],\n        path_indices: List[int],\n        path_coefficients: List[float],\n        batch_size: int,\n        tensors: List[torch.Tensor],\n    ) -> List[torch.Tensor]:\n        return torch.ops.cuequivariance.uniform_1d(\n            name,","caption":"uniform_1d：调用二进制包注册的 torch 自定义算子","url":"https://github.com/NVIDIA/cuEquivariance/blob/9ed8c7613a79861415071027249cc458e423be30/cuequivariance_torch/cuequivariance_torch/primitives/segmented_polynomial_uniform_1d.py#L24-L56"},{"repo":"cuEquivariance","file":"cuequivariance_torch/cuequivariance_torch/primitives/segmented_polynomial_fused_tp.py","start":27,"end":41,"lang":"python","excerpt":"class FusedTP3(nn.Module):\n    def __init__(self, d: cue.SegmentedTensorProduct, math_dtype: torch.dtype):\n        super().__init__()\n        import cuequivariance_ops_torch as ops\n\n        self.tp = ops.FusedTensorProductOp3(\n            operand_segment_modes=d.subscripts.operands,\n            operand_segment_offsets=[\n                [s.start for s in ope.segment_slices()] for ope in d.operands\n            ],\n            operand_segment_shapes=[ope.segments for ope in d.operands],\n            path_indices=d.indices,\n            path_coefficients=d.stacked_coefficients,\n            math_dtype=math_dtype,\n        )","caption":"fused_tp：把段偏移、段形状、路径索引与系数交给 FusedTensorProductOp3","url":"https://github.com/NVIDIA/cuEquivariance/blob/9ed8c7613a79861415071027249cc458e423be30/cuequivariance_torch/cuequivariance_torch/primitives/segmented_polynomial_fused_tp.py#L27-L41"}]},{"stage":"output","title":"从描述符到内核参数：均匀段 + 拍平的路径表","plain":"uniform_1d 内核的前提：每个操作数是标量或一维段、同一操作数的所有段等长、所有一维操作数共享同一个段长（通常就是通道数），且路径系数是标量。满足后，所有路径的段索引与系数被拍平成整数/浮点数组，连同各缓冲区的段数一起传给内核。源码提示：段长小于 32 或不是 32 的倍数时 GPU 效率较低。描述符还自带 flop()，用 opt_einsum 估算每条路径的最优收缩代价。","math":"\\mathrm{FLOP}=B\\sum_{p\\in\\text{paths}}\\mathrm{cost}_{\\mathrm{opt}}\\Big(C^{(p)},\\,x_1\\big[s_1^{(p)}\\big],\\dots,x_{n-1}\\big[s_{n-1}^{(p)}\\big]\\Big)","code":[{"repo":"cuEquivariance","file":"cuequivariance_torch/cuequivariance_torch/primitives/segmented_polynomial_uniform_1d.py","start":132,"end":155,"lang":"python","excerpt":"    torch._assert(\n        o.all_same_segment_shape(),\n        \"For method 'uniform_1d', all segments of a given operand must have the \"\n        \"same shape. If segment extents differ but share a non-trivial greatest \"\n        \"common divisor, you may preprocess the polynomial with 'split_mode()' \"\n        \"on the corresponding mode to factor out this divisor and obtain \"\n        \"uniform segment extents. Using 'split_mode()' in this way increases \"\n        \"the number of segments and tensor-product paths, which can degrade \"\n        \"performance. In particular, choosing a very small common divisor \"\n        \"relative to the largest extent (for example, extents [64, 128, 2] \"\n        \"with gcd=2) creates many short segments, and segment extents smaller \"\n        \"than 32 or not divisible by 32 are generally inefficient on the GPU.\",\n    )\n    if o.ndim == 1 and len(o.segments) > 0:\n        if operand_extent is None:\n            (operand_extent,) = o.segment_shape\n        else:\n            torch._assert(\n                (operand_extent,) == o.segment_shape,\n                \"For method 'uniform_1d', all 1D operands must share the same \"\n                \"segment extent (a single uniform mode across operands).\",\n            )\nif operand_extent is None:\n    operand_extent = 1","caption":"uniform_1d 前提检查：段形状一致、单一段长","url":"https://github.com/NVIDIA/cuEquivariance/blob/9ed8c7613a79861415071027249cc458e423be30/cuequivariance_torch/cuequivariance_torch/primitives/segmented_polynomial_uniform_1d.py#L132-L155"},{"repo":"cuEquivariance","file":"cuequivariance_torch/cuequivariance_torch/primitives/segmented_polynomial_uniform_1d.py","start":201,"end":218,"lang":"python","excerpt":"self.num_operations = len(polynomial.operations)\nself.num_operands = [len(o.buffers) for o, stp in polynomial.operations]\nself.operations = [b for o, stp in polynomial.operations for b in o.buffers]\nself.num_paths = [stp.num_paths for o, stp in polynomial.operations]\nself.path_indices_start = [0] + list(\n    accumulate(\n        [stp.num_paths * stp.num_operands for o, stp in polynomial.operations]\n    )\n)[:-1]\nself.path_coefficients_start = [0] + list(\n    accumulate([stp.num_paths for o, stp in polynomial.operations])\n)[:-1]\nself.path_indices = [\n    i for o, stp in polynomial.operations for p in stp.paths for i in p.indices\n]\nself.path_coefficients = [\n    float(p.coefficients) for o, stp in polynomial.operations for p in stp.paths\n]","caption":"把各运算的路径索引与系数拍平成内核参数数组","url":"https://github.com/NVIDIA/cuEquivariance/blob/9ed8c7613a79861415071027249cc458e423be30/cuequivariance_torch/cuequivariance_torch/primitives/segmented_polynomial_uniform_1d.py#L201-L218"},{"repo":"cuEquivariance","file":"cuequivariance/cuequivariance/segmented_polynomials/segmented_tensor_product.py","start":621,"end":649,"lang":"python","excerpt":"d = self.move_operand_last(operand)\nsubscripts = (\n    d.coefficient_subscripts\n    + \"\".join(\",\" + ss for ss in d.subscripts.operands[:-1])\n    + \"->\"\n    + d.subscripts.operands[-1]\n)\n\n@functools.cache\ndef compute_cost(segment_shapes: tuple[tuple[int, ...], ...]) -> int:\n    _, info = opt_einsum.contract_path(\n        subscripts, *segment_shapes, optimize=\"optimal\", shapes=True\n    )\n    if algorithm == \"naive\":\n        return int(info.naive_cost)\n    elif algorithm == \"optimal\":\n        return int(info.opt_cost)\n    else:\n        raise ValueError(f\"unknown algorithm {algorithm}.\")\n\ncost = 0\nfor path in d.paths:\n    shapes = tuple(\n        d.get_segment_shape(oid, path) for oid in range(d.num_operands - 1)\n    )\n    dims = d.get_path_dimensions_dict(path)\n    coeff_shape = tuple(dims[ch] for ch in d.coefficient_subscripts)\n    cost += compute_cost((coeff_shape,) + shapes)\nreturn cost * batch_size","caption":"STP.flop：逐路径用 opt_einsum 估算计算量","url":"https://github.com/NVIDIA/cuEquivariance/blob/9ed8c7613a79861415071027249cc458e423be30/cuequivariance/cuequivariance/segmented_polynomials/segmented_tensor_product.py#L621-L649"}]},{"stage":"output","title":"MACE / NequIP 如何接入","plain":"MACE：计算器设 enable_cueq=True 时调用 run_e3nn_to_cueq，按原配置新建一个 cueq_config(enabled=True, optimize_all=True) 的同构模型，再把 e3nn 权重逐一搬过去（transfer_weights），所以预训练权重无需重训；训练脚本也有 --enable_cueq / --cueq_conv_fusion 开关。NequIP：enable_CuEquivariance 修饰器把每个 TensorProductScatter 替换为 CuEquivarianceTensorProductScatter（官方标注为 ALPHA 支持，面向推理加速），内部用改写的通道级描述符 + fused_tp。","math":"\\text{e3nn model}\\xrightarrow{\\ \\texttt{run\\_e3nn\\_to\\_cueq}\\ }\\text{cuEq model},\\qquad \\theta_{\\text{cuEq}}=\\mathcal T\\big(\\theta_{\\text{e3nn}}\\big)","code":[{"repo":"mace","file":"mace/cli/convert_e3nn_cueq.py","start":246,"end":269,"lang":"python","excerpt":"# Add cuequivariance config\nconfig[\"cueq_config\"] = CuEquivarianceConfig(\n    enabled=True,\n    layout=layout,\n    group=\"O3_e3nn\",\n    optimize_all=True,\n    conv_fusion=conv_fusion and torch.device(device).type == \"cuda\",\n)\n\n# Create new model with cuequivariance config\nlogging.info(\"Creating new model with cuequivariance settings\")\ntarget_model = source_model.__class__(**config).to(device)\n\n# Transfer weights with proper remapping\nnum_layers = config[\"num_interactions\"]\ntransfer_weights(\n    source_model,\n    target_model,\n    num_product_irreps,\n    correlation,\n    num_layers,\n    use_reduced_cg,\n    keep_last_layer_irreps,\n)","caption":"run_e3nn_to_cueq：启用 cueq 配置重建模型并迁移权重","url":"https://github.com/ACEsuit/mace/blob/7215fadd3b591444ab2c07634e84419685a48e87/mace/cli/convert_e3nn_cueq.py#L246-L269"},{"repo":"mace","file":"mace/calculators/mace.py","start":385,"end":390,"lang":"python","excerpt":"elif enable_cueq:\n    logging.info(\"Converting models to CuEq for acceleration\")\n    self.models = [\n        run_e3nn_to_cueq(model, device=device).to(device)\n        for model in self.models\n    ]","caption":"MACECalculator(enable_cueq=True) 加载时自动转换","url":"https://github.com/ACEsuit/mace/blob/7215fadd3b591444ab2c07634e84419685a48e87/mace/calculators/mace.py#L385-L390"},{"repo":"nequip","file":"nequip/nn/_tp_scatter_base.py","start":86,"end":102,"lang":"python","excerpt":"def enable_CuEquivariance(cls, model):\n    \"\"\"\n    [ALPHA SUPPORT] Enable CuEquivariance tensor product kernel for accelerated NequIP inference.\n    For usage instructions, see https://nequip.readthedocs.io/en/latest/guide/accelerations/cuequivariance.html\n    \"\"\"\n\n    from ._tp_scatter_cueq import CuEquivarianceTensorProductScatter\n    from nequip.utils.dtype import torch_default_dtype\n\n    def factory(old):\n        with torch_default_dtype(old.model_dtype):\n            new = CuEquivarianceTensorProductScatter(\n                feature_irreps_in=old.feature_irreps_in,\n                irreps_edge_attr=old.irreps_edge_attr,\n                irreps_mid=old.irreps_mid,\n                instructions=old.instructions,\n            )","caption":"NequIP enable_CuEquivariance：替换张量积 + scatter 模块","url":"https://github.com/mir-group/nequip/blob/27d9d2182da918ab7be0017d8300e53278f5e00e/nequip/nn/_tp_scatter_base.py#L86-L102"}]},{"stage":"output","title":"三角注意力与三角乘法更新（面向 AlphaFold 类模型）","plain":"除等变张量积外，库里还提供 AlphaFold 系结构模型常用的成对表示算子：三角注意力（对每一行做带偏置 B 与掩码 M 的注意力）、三角乘法更新（outgoing / incoming 两个方向，含 LayerNorm、门控与投影）以及 attention_pair_bias。它们与 MLFF 的能量/力计算无直接关系；PyTorch 前端同样只做参数检查，再调用 cuequivariance_ops_torch 中的内核。","math":"\\mathrm{Attn}_q(Q,K,V,B,M)=\\sum_k\\mathrm{softmax}_k\\big(s\\,Q_q\\cdot K_k+B_{qk}\\big)V_k\\qquad(M_k=1)","code":[{"repo":"cuEquivariance","file":"cuequivariance_torch/cuequivariance_torch/primitives/triangle.py","start":75,"end":94,"lang":"python","excerpt":"def triangle_attention(\n    q: torch.Tensor,\n    k: torch.Tensor,\n    v: torch.Tensor,\n    bias: torch.Tensor,\n    mask: Optional[torch.Tensor] = None,\n    scale: Optional[float] = None,\n    return_aux: bool = False,\n    *,\n    kv_lengths: Optional[torch.Tensor] = None,\n) -> torch.Tensor | Tuple[torch.Tensor, torch.Tensor, torch.Tensor]:\n    r\"\"\"\n    Triangle Attention\n\n    .. math::\n\n        \\text{Attention}_q(Q, K, V, B, M) = \\sum_k\\left[\\text{softmax}_k\\left(\\begin{cases}\n        s\\, Q_q \\cdot K_k + B_{qk} & \\text{if } M_k = 1 \\\\\n        -10^9 & \\text{otherwise}\n        \\end{cases}\\right) V_k \\right]","caption":"triangle_attention 的接口与公式","url":"https://github.com/NVIDIA/cuEquivariance/blob/9ed8c7613a79861415071027249cc458e423be30/cuequivariance_torch/cuequivariance_torch/primitives/triangle.py#L75-L94"},{"repo":"cuEquivariance","file":"cuequivariance_torch/cuequivariance_torch/primitives/triangle.py","start":198,"end":205,"lang":"python","excerpt":"try:\n    from cuequivariance_ops_torch import triangle_attention as f\nexcept Exception:\n    raise ImportError(\n        \"Error importing triangle_attention from cuequivariance_ops_torch.\"\n    )\nelse:\n    return f(q, k, v, bias, mask, scale, return_aux, kv_lengths=kv_lengths)","caption":"转发到二进制内核包","url":"https://github.com/NVIDIA/cuEquivariance/blob/9ed8c7613a79861415071027249cc458e423be30/cuequivariance_torch/cuequivariance_torch/primitives/triangle.py#L198-L205"},{"repo":"cuEquivariance","file":"cuequivariance_torch/cuequivariance_torch/primitives/triangle.py","start":313,"end":325,"lang":"python","excerpt":"try:\n    from cuequivariance_ops_torch import triangle_multiplicative_update as f\nexcept Exception:\n    raise ImportError(\n        \"Error importing triangle_multiplicative_update from cuequivariance_ops_torch.\"\n    )\nelse:\n    return f(\n        x,\n        direction,\n        mask=mask,\n        norm_in_weight=norm_in_weight,\n        norm_in_bias=norm_in_bias,","caption":"triangle_multiplicative_update：同样由内核包实现","url":"https://github.com/NVIDIA/cuEquivariance/blob/9ed8c7613a79861415071027249cc458e423be30/cuequivariance_torch/cuequivariance_torch/primitives/triangle.py#L313-L325"}]}],"hyper":[{"name":"layout（MACE CuEquivarianceConfig 默认）","value":"mul_ir；optimize_* 与 conv_fusion 默认 False","note":"与 e3nn 相同的布局","code":{"repo":"mace","file":"mace/modules/wrapper_ops.py","start":33,"end":45,"lang":"python","excerpt":"class CuEquivarianceConfig:\n    \"\"\"Configuration for cuequivariance acceleration\"\"\"\n\n    enabled: bool = False\n    layout: str = \"mul_ir\"  # One of: mul_ir, ir_mul\n    layout_str: str = \"mul_ir\"\n    group: str = \"O3\"\n    optimize_all: bool = False  # Set to True to enable all optimizations\n    optimize_linear: bool = False\n    optimize_channelwise: bool = False\n    optimize_symmetric: bool = False\n    optimize_fctp: bool = False\n    conv_fusion: bool = False  # Set to True to enable conv fusion","caption":"","url":"https://github.com/ACEsuit/mace/blob/7215fadd3b591444ab2c07634e84419685a48e87/mace/modules/wrapper_ops.py#L33-L45"}},{"name":"run_e3nn_to_cueq 默认","value":"layout=ir_mul，group=O3_e3nn，optimize_all=True，conv_fusion=True（仅 CUDA 设备）","note":"MACE 计算器 enable_cueq=True 时使用","code":{"repo":"mace","file":"mace/cli/convert_e3nn_cueq.py","start":218,"end":253,"lang":"python","excerpt":"def run(\n    input_model,\n    output_model=\"_cueq.model\",\n    device=\"cpu\",\n    return_model=True,\n    layout: str = \"ir_mul\",\n    conv_fusion: bool = True,\n):\n    # Setup logging\n\n    # Load original model\n    # logging.warning(f\"Loading model\")\n    # check if input_model is a path or a model\n    if isinstance(input_model, str):\n        source_model = torch.load(input_model, map_location=device)\n    else:\n        source_model = input_model\n    default_dtype = next(source_model.parameters()).dtype\n    torch.set_default_dtype(default_dtype)\n    # Extract configuration\n    config = extract_config_mace_model(source_model)\n\n    # Get max_L and correlation from config\n    num_product_irreps = len(config[\"hidden_irreps\"].slices()) - 1\n    correlation = config[\"correlation\"]\n    use_reduced_cg = config.get(\"use_reduced_cg\", True)\n    keep_last_layer_irreps = config.get(\"keep_last_layer_irreps\", False)\n\n    # Add cuequivariance config\n    config[\"cueq_config\"] = CuEquivarianceConfig(\n        enabled=True,\n        layout=layout,\n        group=\"O3_e3nn\",\n        optimize_all=True,\n        conv_fusion=conv_fusion and torch.device(device).type == \"cuda\",\n    )","caption":"","url":"https://github.com/ACEsuit/mace/blob/7215fadd3b591444ab2c07634e84419685a48e87/mace/cli/convert_e3nn_cueq.py#L218-L253"}},{"name":"MACE 训练开关","value":"--enable_cueq False，--only_cueq False，--cueq_conv_fusion False","note":"训练时需显式打开","code":{"repo":"mace","file":"mace/tools/arg_parser.py","start":1102,"end":1120,"lang":"python","excerpt":"# option for cuequivariance acceleration\nparser.add_argument(\n    \"--enable_cueq\",\n    help=\"Enable cuequivariance acceleration\",\n    type=str2bool,\n    default=False,\n)\nparser.add_argument(\n    \"--only_cueq\",\n    help=\"Only use cuequivariance acceleration\",\n    type=str2bool,\n    default=False,\n)\nparser.add_argument(\n    \"--cueq_conv_fusion\",\n    help=\"Enable cuEquivariance convolution fusion during training\",\n    type=str2bool,\n    default=False,\n)","caption":"","url":"https://github.com/ACEsuit/mace/blob/7215fadd3b591444ab2c07634e84419685a48e87/mace/tools/arg_parser.py#L1102-L1120"}},{"name":"cuet.SegmentedPolynomial method","value":"未指定时默认 uniform_1d（并警告）；无内核包时回退 naive","note":"v0.6.0 起建议显式指定","code":{"repo":"cuEquivariance","file":"cuequivariance_torch/cuequivariance_torch/primitives/segmented_polynomial.py","start":161,"end":173,"lang":"python","excerpt":"if method == \"\":\n    warnings.warn(\n        \"Hello! It looks like you're using code that was written for an older version of this library.\\n\"\n        \"Starting in v0.6.0, the `method` argument is suggested when using `SegmentedPolynomial()`.\\n\"\n        \"This change helps ensure you get optimal performance by explicitly choosing the computation method.\\n\"\n        \"For the moment, we will default to the 'uniform_1d' method.\\n\\n\"\n        \"To remove this warning, add a `method` parameter to your function call. Here are the available options:\\n\"\n        \"• 'naive' - Works everywhere but not optimized (good for testing)\\n\"\n        \"• 'uniform_1d' - Fast CUDA implementation for single uniform mode polynomials\\n\"\n        \"• 'fused_tp' - A more general CUDA implementation, supporting many 3 and 4 operands contractions.\\n\"\n        \"• 'indexed_linear' - A CUDA implementation for linear layers with indexed weights.\\n\"\n    )\n    method = \"uniform_1d\"","caption":"","url":"https://github.com/NVIDIA/cuEquivariance/blob/9ed8c7613a79861415071027249cc458e423be30/cuequivariance_torch/cuequivariance_torch/primitives/segmented_polynomial.py#L161-L173"}},{"name":"math_dtype（uniform_1d）","value":"float32 / float64 / None（跟随输入）","note":"内核内部计算精度","code":{"repo":"cuEquivariance","file":"cuequivariance_torch/cuequivariance_torch/primitives/segmented_polynomial_uniform_1d.py","start":172,"end":187,"lang":"python","excerpt":"if isinstance(math_dtype, str):\n    try:\n        # Accept string names like \"float32\" or \"float64\"\n        math_dtype = getattr(torch, math_dtype)\n    except AttributeError:\n        raise ValueError(\n            f\"Invalid math_dtype '{math_dtype}' for method 'uniform_1d'. \"\n            \"Expected 'float32', 'float64', or None.\"\n        )\nif math_dtype not in [None, torch.float32, torch.float64]:\n    raise ValueError(\n        \"For method 'uniform_1d', math_dtype must be 'float32', \"\n        \"'float64', or None; got \"\n        f\"{math_dtype}\"\n    )\nself.math_dtype = math_dtype","caption":"","url":"https://github.com/NVIDIA/cuEquivariance/blob/9ed8c7613a79861415071027249cc458e423be30/cuequivariance_torch/cuequivariance_torch/primitives/segmented_polynomial_uniform_1d.py#L172-L187"}},{"name":"SphericalHarmonics","value":"normalize=True；method 默认 uniform_1d","note":"输入为 (batch, 3) 向量","code":{"repo":"cuEquivariance","file":"cuequivariance_torch/cuequivariance_torch/operations/spherical_harmonics.py","start":29,"end":37,"lang":"python","excerpt":"def __init__(\n    self,\n    ls: list[int],\n    normalize: bool = True,\n    device: Optional[torch.device] = None,\n    math_dtype: Optional[str | torch.dtype] = None,\n    use_fallback: Optional[bool] = None,\n    method: Optional[str] = None,\n):","caption":"","url":"https://github.com/NVIDIA/cuEquivariance/blob/9ed8c7613a79861415071027249cc458e423be30/cuequivariance_torch/cuequivariance_torch/operations/spherical_harmonics.py#L29-L37"}},{"name":"ChannelWiseTensorProduct layout","value":"默认 cue.mul_ir","note":"与 e3nn 兼容；描述符内部为 ir_mul","code":{"repo":"cuEquivariance","file":"cuequivariance_torch/cuequivariance_torch/operations/tp_channel_wise.py","start":38,"end":41,"lang":"python","excerpt":"layout (IrrepsLayout, optional): The layout of the input and output irreps. Default is ``cue.mul_ir`` which is the layout corresponding to e3nn.\nlayout_in1 (IrrepsLayout, optional): The layout of the first input irreducible representations, by default ``layout``.\nlayout_in2 (IrrepsLayout, optional): The layout of the second input irreducible representations, by default ``layout``.\nlayout_out (IrrepsLayout, optional): The layout of the output irreducible representations, by default ``layout``.","caption":"","url":"https://github.com/NVIDIA/cuEquivariance/blob/9ed8c7613a79861415071027249cc458e423be30/cuequivariance_torch/cuequivariance_torch/operations/tp_channel_wise.py#L38-L41"}},{"name":"SymmetricContraction original_mace","value":"False（MACE 中取 not use_reduced_cg）","note":"True 时用投影矩阵复现原版 MACE 权重参数化","code":{"repo":"cuEquivariance","file":"cuequivariance_torch/cuequivariance_torch/operations/symmetric_contraction.py","start":113,"end":121,"lang":"python","excerpt":"layout: Optional[cue.IrrepsLayout] = None,\nlayout_in: Optional[cue.IrrepsLayout] = None,\nlayout_out: Optional[cue.IrrepsLayout] = None,\ndevice: Optional[torch.device] = None,\ndtype: Optional[torch.dtype] = None,\nmath_dtype: Optional[str | torch.dtype] = None,\noriginal_mace: bool = False,\nuse_fallback: Optional[bool] = None,\nmethod: Optional[str] = None,","caption":"","url":"https://github.com/NVIDIA/cuEquivariance/blob/9ed8c7613a79861415071027249cc458e423be30/cuequivariance_torch/cuequivariance_torch/operations/symmetric_contraction.py#L113-L121"}},{"name":"JAX method","value":"naive / uniform_1d / indexed_linear；非 CUDA 平台自动回退 naive","note":"cuequivariance_jax 前端","code":{"repo":"cuEquivariance","file":"cuequivariance_jax/cuequivariance_jax/segmented_polynomials/segmented_polynomial.py","start":519,"end":526,"lang":"python","excerpt":"assert method in (\"naive\", \"uniform_1d\", \"indexed_linear\")\nif platform != \"cuda\" and method != \"naive\":\n    warnings.warn(\n        f\"Method '{method}' requires CUDA, but platform is '{platform}'. \"\n        \"Falling back to 'naive' implementation.\",\n        stacklevel=2,\n    )\n    method = \"naive\"","caption":"","url":"https://github.com/NVIDIA/cuEquivariance/blob/9ed8c7613a79861415071027249cc458e423be30/cuequivariance_jax/cuequivariance_jax/segmented_polynomials/segmented_polynomial.py#L519-L526"}},{"name":"triangle_multiplicative_update eps","value":"1e-5","note":"LayerNorm 稳定项；文档注明 hidden_dim 需为 32 的倍数","code":{"repo":"cuEquivariance","file":"cuequivariance_torch/cuequivariance_torch/primitives/triangle.py","start":208,"end":226,"lang":"python","excerpt":"def triangle_multiplicative_update(\n    x: torch.Tensor,\n    direction: str = \"outgoing\",\n    mask: Optional[torch.Tensor] = None,\n    norm_in_weight: Optional[torch.Tensor] = None,\n    norm_in_bias: Optional[torch.Tensor] = None,\n    p_in_weight: Optional[torch.Tensor] = None,\n    p_in_bias: Optional[torch.Tensor] = None,\n    g_in_weight: Optional[torch.Tensor] = None,\n    g_in_bias: Optional[torch.Tensor] = None,\n    norm_out_weight: Optional[torch.Tensor] = None,\n    norm_out_bias: Optional[torch.Tensor] = None,\n    p_out_weight: Optional[torch.Tensor] = None,\n    p_out_bias: Optional[torch.Tensor] = None,\n    g_out_weight: Optional[torch.Tensor] = None,\n    g_out_bias: Optional[torch.Tensor] = None,\n    eps: float = 1e-5,\n    precision: Optional[TriMulPrecision] = None,\n) -> torch.Tensor:","caption":"","url":"https://github.com/NVIDIA/cuEquivariance/blob/9ed8c7613a79861415071027249cc458e423be30/cuequivariance_torch/cuequivariance_torch/primitives/triangle.py#L208-L226"}}],"speedNotes":["等变 MLFF 的 FLOPs 大头在边上的 CG 张量积和（MACE 的）节点对称收缩；朴素实现逐路径做小 einsum 并产生中间张量，cuEquivariance 把整个分段多项式交给一个 CUDA 内核执行。","gather–TP–scatter 融合（input/output indices）避免物化“边数 × 通道”的边特征张量；官方文档称相对 e3nn 有显著性能提升，并用 MACE 基准图标出单卡显存允许的最大原子数（只有图，此处不引用具体数值）。","uniform_1d 只接受“单一均匀模式”的描述符：段长一致、系数为标量；源码提示段长 <32 或非 32 倍数时 GPU 低效，所以隐藏通道数取 32 的倍数更划算；不满足时 ChannelWiseTensorProduct 退回 naive。","uniform_1d 的 math_dtype 只支持 FP32/FP64；STP.flop() 与 JAX 前端打印的 GFLOP / 算术强度可帮助判断瓶颈在算力还是带宽。","布局转置本身也有开销：MACE 转换脚本默认整网使用 ir_mul，布局一致时转置退化为恒等映射。"],"weakNotes":["cuEquivariance 只替换算子、不改变模型数学：截断半径、感受野、是否含色散/静电完全由上层模型（MACE、NequIP…）决定，加速前后能量应一致。","库中没有邻居表、截断包络、电荷或长程模块；卷积层只接收调用方传入的 edge_envelope 作为截断衰减。","MACE 转换只是把 e3nn 权重搬到 cuEq 模块（transfer_weights），因此基于 PBE 数据训练的 MACE-MP 等模型缺 vdW 的问题依旧，层状材料、物理吸附等仍需另加 D3 等修正。","弱相互作用常是微小能量差：使用 FP32 内核或三角算子的 TF32/BF16 精度前，应与 e3nn / FP64 结果对比；MACE 提供 cueq→e3nn 的反向转换脚本（convert_cueq_e3nn）便于核对。"],"downstreamNotes":["MD / 结构优化：加速每一步的力计算（前向 + 反传），对大体系、长时间 MD 与主动学习采样最有价值；MACE 计算器设 enable_cueq=True 即可，create_lammps_model 源码注释表明默认启用 cuEquivariance。","声子 / Hessian 需要二阶导：库的测试工具含 run_bwd_bwd_test（create_graph=True 的二次反传检查），但具体模型的 Hessian 结果仍应与 e3nn 实现对比验证。","训练与微调：MACE 训练脚本的 --enable_cueq / --cueq_conv_fusion 可在训练阶段使用；NequIP 的 enable_CuEquivariance 标注为 ALPHA，主要面向推理。","跨领域：JAX 前端（含 Flax NNX 层）便于 JAX 系模型复用同一套描述符；三角注意力/乘法算子服务于蛋白质结构预测等非 MLFF 任务。"],"strengths":["统一描述符：CG 张量积、球谐、对称收缩、线性层、旋转都写成分段张量积/多项式","融合 CUDA 内核 + gather/scatter 融合，减少中间张量与显存","PyTorch / JAX 双前端，无内核包时自动退回 naive 实现","MACE、NequIP 官方集成，权重可与 e3nn 互相转换"],"weaknesses":["CUDA 内核以二进制 wheel 发布，仅支持 Linux x86_64/aarch64 + NVIDIA GPU，内核源码不在开源仓库中","uniform_1d 要求段长一致，不规则 irreps 会退回较慢的 naive","仍处 Beta 阶段，API 变动较快（如 v0.6.0 起建议显式指定 method）","只加速算子，不弥补上层模型在长程、色散等方面的物理缺陷"],"pretrained":[],"mbdKeys":[],"arenaKeys":[],"scores":null,"sources":{"cuEquivariance":{"url":"https://github.com/NVIDIA/cuEquivariance","commit":"9ed8c7613a79861415071027249cc458e423be30","date":"2026-11-05"}}};
